  "css": "A.b:link,a:link,a:visited{font-family:\"굴림\"; color:#0000ff;text-decoration:none}\na:hover{font-family:\"굴림\";color: #ff0000;text-decoration: underline}",
  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a name=\"top\"></a></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"> <p><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/u.gif\" width=\"24\">O. \n                            Combat&amp;Jobs</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:60%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"590\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background.gif\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_anit/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">길들이기(Taming)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l&nbsp;</font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_anit_1/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">테이밍스킬수치표</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_anit_2/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">주요스폰장소</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_anil/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">동물지식(Animal Lore)</font></a></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_vet/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">동물붕대힐(Veterinary)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> l 목동술(Herding)</font></span></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#999933\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"560\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"554\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:5; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">동물을 \n\n                            테임할 때는 테임스킬을 일단 구동 하시고 타겟이 뜨면 \n\n                            원하는 \n\n                            동물을 찍어 주시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">테임중에 \n\n                            공격적인 동물은 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"</span><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">당신은 그동물을 화나게 하는 것 같습니다</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"라는 \n\n                            메시지가 보입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">무시하시고 \n\n                            계속 시도 하시면 됩니다. </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이때는 스킬딜레이가 거의 \n\n                            없으니 계속 \n\n                            테임을 시도 하시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물론 \n\n                            드래곤의 블레스(아머와 레지에 관계없이 약 40정도의 \n\n                            데미지,</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">드레이크는약 \n\n                            20정도의데미지를 줍니다)를 조심하시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">테이머는 \n\n                            마사테이머,바드테이머,전사테이머등 많은 스킬을 조합할 \n\n                            수 있지만 일단은 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">애니멀로어,메저리,메디는 기본적으로 \n                                        추가되야 \n\n                            한다는 사실을 명심하시길 바랍니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">p.s \n\n                            : 예전에는 로어스킬까지 제외시키고 오로지 테이밍만 \n\n                            키우는</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">분들이 \n\n                            많았습니다. 이것은 동물을 다른분에게 팔아서 돈을 \n\n                            버는 분들이었지만</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:5;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">패치이후에는 \n\n                            마굿간의 맡길수있는 수패치와 리스폰의 수등으로 메리트가 \n\n                            없어졌습니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"222\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill_index/images/uojobs/animal/tame_4.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"250\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:250/250\" width=\"250\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"328\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">좌측에 \n\n                            그림은 여러분도 잘아시는</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">디싯눈섬입니다. \n\n                            </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">처음 \n\n                            하시는분부터 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">마스터수준이상까지도 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">가능한 \n\n                            동물이 모여 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이곳말고도 \n\n                            T2A지역에도 눈섬이 있어서</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">화이트울프가 \n\n                            있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(UO.Tip란 \n\n                            레어란에 아이스봉관련참조)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이곳말고도 \n\n                            처음하시는분들은 베스퍼동쪽숲이나 문글로우 남쪽 \n\n                            숲등에서</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">기본적으로 \n\n                            테임이 가능한 동물을</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">시도 \n\n                            하시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"222\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill_index/images/uojobs/animal/tame_1.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"208\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:250/208\" width=\"250\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"328\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\">\n<font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">젤롬마을에 젤롬 목장이 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">황소가 \n\n                            몇마리 젠이되니 이곳도</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">놓칠 \n\n                            수 없는 지역입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬 \n                                        84정도 되시면 릿지백을 테임하시는것도</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">좋습니다. \n                                        </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">릿지백은 \n                                        일쉐나 지역에 세비지캠프에 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">자세한 \n                                        지도는 여기를 </span></font><a href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Exodus/\"><font color=\"red\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Click</b></span></font></a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"222\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill_index/images/uojobs/animal/tame_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"250\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:250/250\" width=\"250\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"328\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">약 \n\n                            90이상부터 주로 가게 되는 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">델루시아 \n\n                            목장입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">황소로 \n\n                            충분히 100까지 올릴 수 있고 황소가 \n\n                            </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">약 4-5마리정도 리젠이 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">릿지백을 \n                                        테임하시는것도 좋습니다. </span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"554\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;■ </span><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">공격적인 \n\n                            동물길들이는 방법</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"237\" width=\"222\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill_index/images/uojobs/animal/tame_7.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"250\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:250/250\" width=\"250\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"237\" width=\"328\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">테이밍은 \n\n                            원하는 동물이나 몬스터를 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">자신의명령을 듣게 하는 \n\n                            </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">매력적인 스킬입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">어렵다고 \n\n                            생각하시는분들은 스킬을 신경쓰지 마시고 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">꾸준히 \n\n                            그리고 천천히 올리시는 것이 가장 좋은 방법입니다..</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">좌측사진은 \n\n                            테임의 기본적인 워킹테임</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이라는 \n\n                            것으로 걸어다니면서 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">드래곤을 \n\n                            꼬시는 방법입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물론 \n\n                            기본적이지만 가장 난이도가</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">있는 \n\n                            테임 방법입니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"554\">\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">말,오타,라마,짐말,광폭등은 \n\n                            야채를 주시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">야채는 \n\n                            마을외곽 엔피씨들이 많이 팔며 물론 잡화점에서도 \n\n                            사실수 있습니다, </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">급하신분은 \n\n                            1써클 음식만들기 마법으로 만드셔도 됩니다</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">곰종류,드래곤,나메,유니콘등은 \n\n                             생고기를 잘먹습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">다른동물의 \n\n                            시체를 해부하여 생고기를 뜯어내 얻을 수 있으며 푸줏간에서도</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">구입하실수 \n\n                            있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">p.s \n\n                            : 각종 동물을 명령내릴 때 쓰는 명령어는 UO.Tip란에 \n\n                            명령어사전을 찾아보시길..</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#999933\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"560\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"522\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ 동물을 \n\n                            맡길 때는 \"</span><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">stable</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"을 마굿간에서 \n\n                            외치시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ 동물을 \n\n                            찿을 때는 \"</span><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">claim</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"을 마굿간에서 \n\n                            외치시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" height=\"30\" width=\"257\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">마굿간에 \n\n                            맡길 수 있는\n\n                            수</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" height=\"30\" width=\"257\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬합</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"257\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">2마리</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"257\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">-</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"257\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">3마리</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"257\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">159.8</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"257\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">4마리</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"257\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">199.8</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"257\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">5마리</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"28\" width=\"257\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">240</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">위의 \n\n                스킬합은 &nbsp;: 애니멀테이밍+애니멀로어+베테리너리의 총합입니다.</span></font> </p><table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"298\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:8;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_skill/\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/menu.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"295\">\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"#top\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/top.gif\" width=\"20